  "7b59c109-97b9-4480-83f5-5e1e2d5a9c78"],
 ". Thus, we finally have the following solution of the geodesic:"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"ac9868f4-e5a0-4041-8844-7601c4263ca3"],

